### Tempo / TraceQL correlation

After a successful batch, the tool prints a TraceQL query snippet that:
- filters by service name (default `"iota"`)
- filters by span name (e.g. `"handle_transaction"`)
- filters by sender (`span.sender`)
- filters by regex matching the batch digests (`span.tx_digest =~ "..."`)